        <mxCell id="t1" value="HarnessPlane Delivery Method v1 · CL-59 r17&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;本图与设计正本 HarnessPlane_Delivery_Method_Design_v1.md 同属一个评审对象与冻结面；Stage 3 内环拓扑唯一权威 = MVP_Workflow_v5.drawio&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
